    "sections": {
        "description": "The Classic Toy Store Theme is a versatile, visually engaging solution designed for toy retailers, toy shops, nostalgic collectors, kids’ stores, and online toy marketplaces, ideal for showcasing classic toys, plush toys, collectible toys, musical toys, Barbie dolls, baby dolls, dollhouses, superhero toys, Disney toys, Marvel toys, Star Wars toys, play kitchens, pretend play toys, toy instruments, kids’ costumes, play tents, ball pits, sand toys, electronic learning toys, kids tablets, coding toys, voice-activated toys, Nerf guns, laser tag sets, science experiment kits, collectible cards like Pokémon and Yu-Gi-Oh, eco-friendly toys, and sustainable toys. With an intuitive, responsive layout, the theme highlights product images using vibrant sliders, interactive galleries, and crisp typography, creating an engaging shopping experience across all devices. Designed for inventory-rich stores, it offers extensive customization options for colors, fonts, layouts, and banners, allowing retailers to reflect their brand’s personality. SEO-friendly and built with optimized code for fast loading, the theme integrates seamlessly with plugins like WooCommerce for product sales and Contact Form 7 for easy customer communication, providing a fully functional, modern, and interactive online presence for toy businesses.Demo:https://live.theclassictemplates.com/classic-toy-store-pro/"
    },
